= Route119_EventScript_BattleMay
msgbox	MAY: PLAYER! Where were you? I was looking for you!How much stronger have you gotten? Let me check for you!Ready with your POKéMON? Of course you are! Go!
switch VAR_STARTER_MON
case 0 Route119_EventScript_BattleMayTreecko
case 1 Route119_EventScript_BattleMayTorchic
case 2 Route119_EventScript_BattleMayMudkip
end
= Route119_EventScript_BattleMayMudkip
trainerbattle_no_intro TRAINER_MAY_ROUTE_119_MUDKIP Route119_Text_MayDefeat
goto Route119_EventScript_DefeatedMay
end
= Route119_EventScript_DefeatedMay
msgbox	MAY: But I had absolutely nothing to worry about! Keep it up!And, here! I have a present for you.
call Route119_EventScript_GiveFlyHM
msgbox	MAY: Use FLY, and your POKéMON will instantly carry you to any town you've already visited.But, to use FLY, you have to get the GYM BADGE from FORTREE CITY. That's important, so don't forget.You should FLY home and visit LITTLEROOT for a change.I bet your mom's worried about you, PLAYER.Well, let's meet again somewhere!
goto Route119_EventScript_RivalExitScottArrive
end
= Route119_EventScript_BattleMayTorchic
trainerbattle_no_intro TRAINER_MAY_ROUTE_119_TORCHIC Route119_Text_MayDefeat
goto Route119_EventScript_DefeatedMay
end
